# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep host artifacts out
# of the image. Without this, `COPY . .` overwrites the container's Linux
# node_modules with the Windows host's (wrong-platform prisma/esbuild binaries)
# and bakes .env secrets into an image layer.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/generated
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
**/*.log
playwright-report
test-results
